WEBVTT

00:02.919 --> 00:05.296
IMPERIAL PALACE
NORLAND'S MANOR

00:05.380 --> 00:06.506
[Arnold] Lord Norland!

00:06.589 --> 00:10.343
It is I, Arnold, here to humbly
inform you that I have returned.

00:11.386 --> 00:12.595
And what do you want?

00:12.679 --> 00:15.306
To notify you that it seems
our missing young Ash

00:15.390 --> 00:18.560
and the person with the Geass
were working alongside the terrorists.

00:19.227 --> 00:20.270
Oh?

00:20.687 --> 00:22.856
I had to question all the guinea pigs
we rounded up.

00:22.939 --> 00:25.900
But we finally found someone
who knew the user's identity

00:25.984 --> 00:28.528
and once I started digging... [laughs]

00:28.611 --> 00:30.071
...it all came spilling out.

00:30.155 --> 00:31.656
[door opens]

00:31.740 --> 00:33.658
[Catherine] Pardon the intrusion.

00:34.284 --> 00:37.495
I can't believe I've been
personally summoned by Lord Norland!

00:37.579 --> 00:39.998
-I'm absolutely over the moon!
-[Arnold] It's been a while.

00:40.081 --> 00:41.166
Huh?

00:41.249 --> 00:43.084
Sorry, who even are you?

00:43.168 --> 00:46.087
No one said anything to me
about getting a new recruit.

00:46.588 --> 00:48.214
You know me, it's Arnold Renck.

00:48.298 --> 00:50.550
I've returned
for the Nameless Mercenaries.

00:50.633 --> 00:51.968
I'm going to kill them.

00:52.052 --> 00:54.095
That's really you, Arnie?

00:54.179 --> 00:56.806
Wow, when did you become such a cutie?

00:56.890 --> 00:58.224
[Scissorman clears throat]

00:58.308 --> 01:01.227
We've already captured
one of the Nameless Mercenaries,

01:01.311 --> 01:04.230
as well as determined the location
of the terrorists' hideout.

01:04.731 --> 01:07.776
We're sending you two out
to ensure they're crushed completely.

01:09.027 --> 01:12.280
Great, because I've been itching
for a way to blow off a little steam!

01:12.947 --> 01:14.407
I want them exterminated.

01:14.491 --> 01:16.076
[Arnold and Catherine] Yes, my lord.

01:16.159 --> 01:18.661
Now if you'll excuse me,
I have some other matters

01:18.745 --> 01:20.705
in need of my careful eye.

01:26.878 --> 01:28.088
SCISSORMAN DOMAIN, ASAHIKAWA

01:28.171 --> 01:30.381
[Scissorman] <i>So, young lady,</i>
<i>shall we begin?</i>

01:31.341 --> 01:35.261
<i>I hope the accommodations</i>
<i>were comfortable enough for you.</i>

01:35.345 --> 01:37.263
[Scissorman laughs wickedly]

01:39.933 --> 01:40.975
[grunts]

01:44.062 --> 01:46.064
[♪ opening theme song playing]

03:19.282 --> 03:20.450
[Yasunaga exclaims] Wait, no--

03:21.993 --> 03:23.203
[Wakui] What the hell?

03:25.914 --> 03:27.457
[Arnold] <i>Hey, Ash!</i>

03:27.540 --> 03:29.459
Where are you hiding?

03:30.627 --> 03:32.420
[Kuroto] <i>Ash, have you found Rozé yet?</i>

03:33.129 --> 03:34.339
[Ash] <i>No, he's not responding.</i>

03:34.422 --> 03:37.175
And no communication
since he left yesterday.

03:37.258 --> 03:40.386
[Kuroto] <i>Copy that.</i>
<i>Then go back up Monobe.</i>

03:40.470 --> 03:41.471
[Ash] <i>Understood.</i>

03:42.931 --> 03:44.349
Do what you can to hold out!

03:50.271 --> 03:51.481
[gasps]

03:52.106 --> 03:54.234
[Arnold] <i>We finally meet again!</i>

03:54.317 --> 03:55.777
Ash!

03:56.319 --> 03:59.614
Is that Arnold? But at Abashiri, I...

04:00.323 --> 04:03.117
[Arnold] <i>And now</i>
<i>I finally get to kill you.</i>

04:03.201 --> 04:04.661
[Arnold chuckles]

04:04.744 --> 04:08.623
I'm so happy. I couldn't be happier!

04:16.506 --> 04:17.507
What?

04:18.675 --> 04:21.094
[Arnold] <i>You said I used</i>
<i>my weapon like a crutch.</i>

04:21.511 --> 04:23.096
<i>So rather than relying on one,</i>

04:23.179 --> 04:26.432
I've been refashioned
into the very weapon itself!

04:26.516 --> 04:29.477
One whose sole purpose is to defeat you!

04:32.939 --> 04:34.440
<i>Running away, are we?</i>

04:34.524 --> 04:36.401
<i>Not very nice.</i>

04:36.484 --> 04:38.945
You're facing me, so man up.

04:44.158 --> 04:46.995
[exclaims] Oh, wow.

04:47.453 --> 04:49.914
<i>Looks like you've got</i>
<i>some nice moves there.</i>

04:49.998 --> 04:53.293
If you're able to follow through,
it looks like we might have some fun.

04:53.793 --> 04:55.003
You'll eat those words!

04:57.255 --> 04:59.966
[Scissorman] <i>According to</i>
<i>General Bartley's documents,</i>

05:00.049 --> 05:03.094
<i>there seem to be a wide variety</i>
<i>of Geass abilities.</i>

05:04.554 --> 05:07.890
<i>From what I've seen in the past,</i>
<i>your ability gives you the power</i>

05:07.974 --> 05:10.476
to take total control
of others' consciousness

05:10.560 --> 05:13.187
and command them to do your bidding.
Is that right?

05:14.731 --> 05:18.776
<i>But I also believe that in order</i>
<i>for you to utilize such a command,</i>

05:18.860 --> 05:22.655
<i>it is necessary for it to be heard or seen</i>
<i>by the desired target.</i>

05:23.781 --> 05:27.076
According to the individuals
we freed from your Geass,

05:27.160 --> 05:31.080
it seems you bypass the voice changer
when it's time to issue your orders,

05:31.164 --> 05:32.832
returning to your natural one.

05:33.458 --> 05:36.461
From this, we can deduce
that channeling your words

05:36.544 --> 05:40.006
through any electronic device
will nullify the effect.

05:41.049 --> 05:43.009
You really freed people from my Geass?

05:43.092 --> 05:45.720
[Scissorman] <i>The technique's</i>
<i>been established for a long time.</i>

05:45.803 --> 05:47.680
<i>Nothing to brag about, really.</i>

05:47.764 --> 05:48.765
[sighs]

05:49.766 --> 05:52.435
<i>I haven't gotten any of this wrong so far,</i>
<i>have I?</i>

05:54.520 --> 05:57.398
<i>This chamber is soundproof.</i>
<i>And bulletproof.</i>

05:57.482 --> 06:01.069
<i>It has a camera and mic,</i>
<i>so communication will be no issue.</i>

06:01.152 --> 06:02.779
<i>Can you believe that we had to whip up</i>

06:02.862 --> 06:05.656
<i>all of this anti-Geass equipment</i>
<i>just for you?</i>

06:05.740 --> 06:08.743
<i>You're certainly what they'd call</i>
<i>high-maintenance, eh?</i>

06:10.495 --> 06:12.622
What exactly do you intend to do with me?

06:13.122 --> 06:15.166
<i>You really want to know?</i>

06:16.209 --> 06:17.710
<i>We'll study you in detail,</i>

06:17.794 --> 06:21.339
which will allow us to develop
our very own Geass!

06:21.422 --> 06:23.299
It's a special project I'm heading.

06:23.383 --> 06:26.260
<i>First off, we'll observe</i>
<i>your Geass' effects.</i>

06:26.344 --> 06:30.723
<i>Physical, emotional, neurological!</i>
<i>We'll do all the experiments!</i>

06:30.807 --> 06:32.475
Once that's over,

06:32.558 --> 06:35.895
we'll slice the subjects
into 0.1 millimeter-sized pieces

06:35.978 --> 06:37.647
and study them thoroughly!

06:37.730 --> 06:40.942
<i>Uh, but I have a promise</i>
<i>to keep before that.</i>

06:44.404 --> 06:45.822
<i>Uncanny resemblance.</i>

06:45.905 --> 06:46.948
[gasps]

06:47.615 --> 06:48.825
It's you, Norland.

06:53.579 --> 06:55.706
[Arnold laughs hysterically]

06:55.790 --> 06:57.375
You're not going anywhere!

06:57.458 --> 06:58.668
Damn it.

07:02.171 --> 07:03.256
[Arnold] <i>Too bad!</i>

07:03.339 --> 07:05.633
My Knightmare has been modified as well.

07:06.467 --> 07:08.302
<i>Everything's been upgraded.</i>

07:09.053 --> 07:11.597
Come. Keep me entertained a while longer!

07:12.181 --> 07:14.225
[metal clanking]

07:15.518 --> 07:17.353
[Catherine] <i>Oh, no.</i>

07:17.437 --> 07:20.148
Are all these "wild swings"
supposed to be attacks?

07:24.694 --> 07:27.280
This is bad. Haruka won't last long!

07:27.905 --> 07:28.990
[Kuroto] Yes, I know.

07:29.490 --> 07:31.617
-[comms device beeps]
-Munemori. Oda.

07:31.701 --> 07:33.202
Haruka needs backup now!

07:33.286 --> 07:35.163
[Oda] <i>Nope, nope, nope,</i>
<i>nope, nope, nope, can't help!</i>

07:35.246 --> 07:37.165
[Shota] <i>We're barely hanging on ourselves!</i>

07:39.250 --> 07:41.377
[Arnold] <i>Come on, fight me!</i>

07:41.461 --> 07:44.589
<i>What, are you daydreaming in there?</i>
<i>Focus on me!</i>

07:44.672 --> 07:46.382
Is this the best you can do?

07:46.466 --> 07:48.968
No wonder you were so easily fooled
by your fake brother!

07:49.051 --> 07:52.138
Fake brother? What does that mean?

07:52.805 --> 07:54.265
Don't tell me you forgot?

07:54.348 --> 07:56.976
<i>Your brother was executed by Lord Norland!</i>

07:57.477 --> 07:58.478
[Ash gasps]

07:59.395 --> 08:01.772
[Norland] <i>You will help me</i>
<i>obtain the power of Geass.</i>

08:03.524 --> 08:04.525
Huh?

08:04.609 --> 08:05.943
<i>Can it be done?</i>

08:08.362 --> 08:10.198
Why? What do you need Geass for?

08:10.281 --> 08:11.991
<i>I am the one asking the questions.</i>

08:13.784 --> 08:14.952
<i>Is that possible?</i>

08:16.037 --> 08:18.581
<i>Answer me, Sakuya Sumeragi.</i>

08:22.376 --> 08:23.503
<i>Very well.</i>

08:24.212 --> 08:26.631
<i>Do with her as you wish. We are done here.</i>

08:27.256 --> 08:28.549
[Scissorman] <i>Understood.</i>

08:29.800 --> 08:31.219
<i>Bring the prisoners in.</i>

08:34.680 --> 08:37.183
Speaking of that fake brother of yours,

08:37.266 --> 08:38.351
I imagine they're being used

08:38.434 --> 08:40.978
as Sir Christoph's lab rat
at this very moment!

08:44.524 --> 08:46.400
[Ash] <i>Nichol was murdered.</i>

08:48.528 --> 08:50.071
[clanging]

08:51.906 --> 08:54.075
<i>And Norland did it.</i>

08:57.703 --> 08:59.288
[panting]

09:05.461 --> 09:06.462
[Knightmare clangs]

09:11.217 --> 09:13.678
[Arnold] Look at you... you're a disgrace!

09:13.761 --> 09:15.888
You don't get to die so easily.

09:16.347 --> 09:19.642
Not before I remove the Geass
that was placed on you.

09:22.395 --> 09:23.938
[Scissorman] <i>All right, young lady.</i>

09:24.021 --> 09:26.691
<i>Go ahead and use your Geass</i>
<i>on these subjects.</i>

09:27.275 --> 09:29.819
-[collar powers up]
-[men whimper]

09:29.902 --> 09:31.862
[Scissorman] <i>Go on. Do it.</i>

09:34.782 --> 09:38.744
Relive the agony of seeing the moment
your brother was killed like a dog.

09:38.828 --> 09:41.289
Ah, I want to watch you quiver in fear.

09:50.631 --> 09:52.049
[Ash whimpers softly]

09:52.133 --> 09:53.426
[Arnold] Yes, that!

09:54.051 --> 09:55.636
That's what I wanted to see!

09:55.720 --> 09:59.265
Now, drown in that
utter despair as you die!

09:59.348 --> 10:00.433
[weapon fires]

10:00.516 --> 10:01.517
[Isao] Ash! You good?

10:02.518 --> 10:03.519
[Arnold] Damn it!

10:07.440 --> 10:08.899
Cut off at the best part.

10:16.032 --> 10:17.950
She keeps darting in and out of range!

10:18.492 --> 10:23.539
[Catherine] <i>Oh, no, what's the matter?</i>
<i>Are you really done already?</i>

10:24.332 --> 10:25.499
I know I'm faster than her.

10:27.251 --> 10:29.211
<i>-Just need to get close!</i>
-[gasps]

10:41.349 --> 10:42.475
[Catherine] <i>The hell was that?</i>

10:43.100 --> 10:45.311
Looks like things
got a little interesting.

10:46.145 --> 10:47.396
Well, in that case...

10:50.733 --> 10:52.902
You think you can take me
without a weapon?

10:53.402 --> 10:55.905
Is this supposed to be some kind of joke?

10:58.074 --> 10:59.700
We came over here as soon as we heard!

10:59.784 --> 11:01.661
The Eastern Dawn Brigade!

11:01.744 --> 11:04.038
Just one after another with these ants.

11:06.999 --> 11:08.459
Whoa, who's that?

11:10.503 --> 11:13.589
It wouldn't feel right to us
if we didn't drop by and repay the favor.

11:14.173 --> 11:15.675
[Kuroto]<i> Iwamoto?</i>

11:15.758 --> 11:17.593
You're a real lifesaver!

11:17.677 --> 11:19.261
-[computer trills]
-Huh?

11:19.929 --> 11:21.180
[Oda] <i>The heck is this?</i>

11:21.263 --> 11:23.265
It's from an anonymous sender.

11:23.849 --> 11:27.895
"Sir Scissorman has a new prisoner,
the younger Nameless Mercenary brother.

11:27.978 --> 11:30.773
"He's being held
at his research facility."

11:34.819 --> 11:36.862
It appears the only recipients
for this message

11:36.946 --> 11:38.572
were the Seven Shining Stars.

11:39.073 --> 11:40.741
[Kuroto] Then it may be a trap.

11:41.367 --> 11:43.244
The Apollo has withdrawn
from the front lines!

11:43.327 --> 11:44.412
[Kuroto] <i>What?</i>

11:47.915 --> 11:49.083
Where are you running?

11:51.335 --> 11:52.336
[grunts]

11:54.755 --> 11:57.925
Let's see if we can lure
the terrorists into action with this.

11:58.884 --> 12:00.803
So much of this Geass nonsense.

12:01.303 --> 12:03.931
I refuse to allow the occult
to get in my way.

12:13.774 --> 12:15.109
[Ash] <i>I don't understand.</i>

12:17.027 --> 12:18.779
<i>What happened to Nichol?</i>

12:19.822 --> 12:21.490
<i>How could I have forgotten about that?</i>

12:26.829 --> 12:28.622
-[inaudible]
-[Ash] <i>Sakuya Sumeragi...</i>

12:29.665 --> 12:31.250
<i>What the hell did you do to me?</i>

12:36.672 --> 12:37.715
[all whimpering]

12:37.798 --> 12:39.300
Please just let us go!

12:39.383 --> 12:40.718
We didn't do anything wrong!

12:40.801 --> 12:43.471
-Don't kill us, please! I'm begging you!
-I don't want to die!

12:44.555 --> 12:45.848
Empress Sakuya!

12:45.931 --> 12:48.267
Majesty! Tell them to spare us!

12:49.101 --> 12:51.979
You have to do something!
We need you to help us!

12:53.230 --> 12:55.691
<i>Come now. Tick tock. Hurry up and do it.</i>

12:56.567 --> 12:58.903
[Sakuya] <i>If I do as I'm told</i>
<i>and use my Geass,</i>

12:58.986 --> 13:00.821
<i>I'll end up getting these people killed.</i>

13:01.405 --> 13:03.532
<i>I've got to think of a way</i>
<i>around all of this.</i>

13:04.825 --> 13:07.703
[Scissorman] <i>I take it you're not a fan</i>
<i>of my little experiment?</i>

13:08.621 --> 13:10.289
I suppose I'm left with no choice.

13:10.372 --> 13:11.457
[gasps]

13:12.458 --> 13:13.501
[collar powering up]

13:19.006 --> 13:20.007
[Sakuya] No...

13:21.842 --> 13:23.344
Well, this didn't work.

13:23.427 --> 13:26.639
I suppose I ought to bring in
someone more important to you

13:26.722 --> 13:28.015
for our next attempt.

13:29.350 --> 13:31.644
[Sakuya] <i>Would they still be alive</i>
<i>if it wasn't for me?</i>

13:32.102 --> 13:33.813
-[alarm blaring]
-[gasps softly]

13:34.355 --> 13:35.356
What's all the racket?

13:35.439 --> 13:36.482
[soldier] We're under attack!

13:36.565 --> 13:39.527
A single Knightmare Frame
has infiltrated the facility!

13:40.820 --> 13:42.947
[Scissorman] Then hurry up
and deploy the guards!

13:43.030 --> 13:46.075
Whatever's going on,
make sure you keep it away from us.

13:46.158 --> 13:47.535
Right! Yes, my lord.

13:48.118 --> 13:49.119
[Scissorman grunts]

13:50.496 --> 13:52.581
[Scissorman] <i>Young Arnold</i>
<i>and Young Catherine...</i>

13:53.290 --> 13:54.708
<i>What failures they are.</i>

13:57.545 --> 13:59.672
[Kuroto] <i>Monobe squad,</i>
<i>Eastern Dawn Brigade,</i>

13:59.755 --> 14:01.006
<i>fan out along the sides.</i>

14:01.090 --> 14:03.968
<i>Be aware of incoming attacks</i>
<i>from the enemy leader's Knightmare.</i>

14:04.051 --> 14:05.135
[Isao] <i>Roger!</i>

14:05.219 --> 14:08.138
Oda and Munemori squad,
head to Point Alpha.

14:08.222 --> 14:10.891
And North Wolf Army,
start moving to Point Bravo!

14:10.975 --> 14:12.059
[Oda and Shota] <i>Roger that!</i>

14:13.018 --> 14:15.020
[Kuroto] <i>We can't hold out forever.</i>

14:20.192 --> 14:22.695
[Yuri] I can't patch all the damage
fast enough!

14:22.778 --> 14:25.072
Everybody! Do the best you can!

14:25.573 --> 14:27.992
Is there anything
you can think of for me to do?

14:28.075 --> 14:30.703
I'm good over here,
but I think that Sano could use a hand.

14:30.786 --> 14:31.871
Right.

14:33.247 --> 14:37.167
[Kuroto] Oda squad, Munemori squad,
form up and flank the enemy's right wing!

14:37.251 --> 14:39.336
-[Oda and Shota] <i>Roger that!</i>
-[beeping]

14:39.420 --> 14:41.130
[Yoko] The Keisetsu is taking a beating.

14:41.213 --> 14:42.464
This doesn't look good.

14:43.549 --> 14:45.968
[Kuroto] <i>Haruka...</i>
<i>hang in a little longer.</i>

14:49.847 --> 14:51.056
This is so boring!

14:51.557 --> 14:53.309
I feel like I could take a nap right now!

14:54.727 --> 14:55.811
[Haruka grunts]

14:57.187 --> 14:58.272
[sighs]

14:58.981 --> 15:00.858
Okay. I'm over this.

15:02.067 --> 15:03.235
I told you,

15:03.319 --> 15:05.112
<i>you're gonna eat those words!</i>

15:07.239 --> 15:08.949
[gunfire]

15:17.124 --> 15:20.461
[Ash] <i>Jugo...</i>
<i>What in the world is your daughter?</i>

15:21.670 --> 15:24.506
[soldier] The enemy Knightmare Frame
looks like it's heading for the lab!

15:24.590 --> 15:27.551
[Scissorman] No avoiding it, then.
I'll head out.

15:36.393 --> 15:38.228
[gasps] It's Ash.

15:40.022 --> 15:45.069
[chuckles] It's been quite a while
since I've seen you, Ash, my boy.

15:45.152 --> 15:49.156
<i>To think you were being brainwashed</i>
<i>by the young lady all this time.</i>

15:49.239 --> 15:50.741
<i>-What a twist.</i>
-[Ash] <i>Move!</i>

15:51.784 --> 15:53.577
[Scissorman] <i>Don't be like that.</i>

15:53.661 --> 15:56.080
<i>Why not indulge your elder</i>
<i>with a bit of chitchat?</i>

15:58.082 --> 16:00.084
[♪ upbeat rock music playing]

16:02.336 --> 16:03.462
[Ash grunts]

16:05.422 --> 16:08.175
It must be so refreshing
to be free of that Geass!

16:08.717 --> 16:11.053
<i>Oh, that's right! I nearly forgot!</i>

16:11.679 --> 16:13.222
<i>That young lady tricked you</i>

16:13.305 --> 16:15.766
<i>and was posing as your brother</i>
<i>right by your side,</i>

16:15.849 --> 16:17.851
<i>like she didn't have a care in the world.</i>

16:18.602 --> 16:20.938
Does she even know the way he was killed?

16:21.021 --> 16:24.233
Did she look into how that mutt
was put down before she wore his skin?

16:24.316 --> 16:25.317
[grunts]

16:27.444 --> 16:30.155
[Scissorman] <i>If you had remained</i>
<i>under her Geass' control,</i>

16:30.239 --> 16:32.408
<i>she would've sucked</i>
<i>what she wanted from you</i>

16:32.491 --> 16:35.869
<i>before tossing you aside</i>
<i>like a husk once she was finished.</i>

16:35.953 --> 16:39.164
Because that's the kind of woman
she's proven herself to be.

16:39.832 --> 16:42.376
No guarantee she won't kill you
if given the chance.

16:42.459 --> 16:45.796
<i>It's good the truth came to light</i>
<i>before that could happen, don't you think?</i>

16:45.879 --> 16:46.880
Shut up!

16:57.349 --> 17:00.811
This is turning into quite the chore.
I'm getting too old for this.

17:04.023 --> 17:05.107
[Catherine] <i>Oh, well...</i>

17:05.733 --> 17:08.027
[in sing-song voice]
<i>I guess that's a wrap for you!</i>

17:08.986 --> 17:10.195
[in normal voice] I did have fun,

17:11.030 --> 17:13.073
<i>but I kinda doubt</i>
<i>we'll see each other again.</i>

17:13.157 --> 17:14.658
-[gunfire]
-[gasps]

17:16.827 --> 17:18.120
Haruka, you okay?

17:18.704 --> 17:20.122
And guess who else is here!

17:20.205 --> 17:23.834
I can't believe I let my guard down. Boys?

17:24.626 --> 17:27.129
<i>You know, ambushing me was super rude!</i>

17:28.797 --> 17:30.799
[grunts] Wait, what the hell was all that?

17:34.887 --> 17:36.221
[all screaming]

17:37.264 --> 17:38.682
Take... this!

17:43.103 --> 17:46.065
[Yoko] Miura squad, Tanaka squad,
all units annihilated!

17:46.148 --> 17:47.858
-[beeping]
-[Yoko gasps]

17:48.400 --> 17:51.820
Neo-Britannian reinforcements
in Block 6, approaching fast!

17:53.697 --> 17:54.823
At this rate...

18:01.205 --> 18:02.414
This is bad!

18:03.916 --> 18:05.709
[Tokio] <i>No matter how you try</i>
<i>and spin this for us,</i>

18:05.793 --> 18:07.669
<i>I'd say we're facing certain doom.</i>

18:09.630 --> 18:10.672
Iwamoto!

18:12.758 --> 18:13.842
[yells]

18:18.847 --> 18:21.433
<i>You youngsters have</i>
<i>a lot of years ahead of you.</i>

18:21.517 --> 18:23.477
<i>It's best if you run along now.</i>

18:23.560 --> 18:24.561
[Kuroto gasps]

18:29.817 --> 18:32.111
[yells]

18:49.503 --> 18:50.921
[Tokio] <i>Well, here we go then.</i>

18:51.463 --> 18:52.965
Make sure to brace yourselves for this.

19:06.478 --> 19:10.774
[Yoko] <i>North Wolf Army,</i>
<i>Eastern Dawn Brigade, all signals lost.</i>

19:13.944 --> 19:17.072
[Kuroto] <i>Monobe squad,</i>
<i>Tsutsuya squad, Kosaka squad,</i>

19:17.156 --> 19:19.867
<i>begin making your retreat</i>
<i>via Point Charlie.</i>

19:20.534 --> 19:24.413
<i>Haruka, Oda, Munemori,</i>
<i>fall back to Point Alpha.</i>

19:27.583 --> 19:30.961
Too bad, they kinda spoiled everything,
didn't they?

19:31.545 --> 19:34.798
<i>Guess I'm done here,</i>
<i>though it was fun while it lasted.</i>

19:45.976 --> 19:49.146
They gave their lives to ensure
that we would survive to help others.

19:49.646 --> 19:53.233
We must be certain
that we live up to their faith in us.

19:56.570 --> 20:00.699
Wonderful, Ash, my boy.
You really have improved quite a bit.

20:17.507 --> 20:18.926
[Ash inhales sharply]

20:25.474 --> 20:27.100
[Scissorman gasps, grunts]

20:31.521 --> 20:32.898
[Scissorman] Enough of this!

20:38.570 --> 20:40.405
[scoffs] Damn it.

21:08.850 --> 21:10.644
You were freed from my Geass?

21:11.353 --> 21:12.354
[Ash] Yeah.

21:15.399 --> 21:19.444
I used an unnatural power. I deceived you.

21:20.279 --> 21:22.823
I pretended to be your brother
to manipulate you.

21:25.200 --> 21:26.285
And I kept doing it,

21:26.994 --> 21:29.371
and never considered
your feelings for Nichol.

21:30.998 --> 21:32.708
I'm truly sorry for what I've done.

21:36.920 --> 21:39.715
I won't carry on this charade
as Rozé any longer.

21:42.092 --> 21:44.177
After I recapture Sakura from Norland,

21:44.845 --> 21:46.972
I'll let you do whatever you wish with me.

21:48.181 --> 21:51.560
If you want, you can shoot me
with that gun holstered at your waist.

21:54.354 --> 21:56.648
I'm aware that
this will be a selfish request...

21:57.524 --> 21:58.859
But I beg you...

22:00.068 --> 22:03.280
won't you please keep helping me
until we save Sakura?

22:31.475 --> 22:33.477
[♪ closing theme song playing]
